#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.desktop
#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "RingoMusic"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"RingoMusic is a native GNOME music player for Apple Music. Use it to browse "
"your library, search the catalog, and play songs, albums, and playlists."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "You must have an Apple Music subscription to use this application."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "The audio quality is AAC 256 kbps."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "The main window"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "An album page"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "The playback queue"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "The narrow layout"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"This release makes favorites and ratings follow Apple Music more closely, "
"and it uses only the functions that Apple documents."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"The \"Dislike\" menu item is now \"Suggest Less\", as in the Apple Music app."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"After each change, the star and \"Suggest Less\" show the state that Apple "
"Music confirms. If Apple Music does not confirm the change, a message tells "
"you."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"To remove an artist from your favorites, use the Apple Music app or "
"music.apple.com. RingoMusic used a function that Apple does not document for "
"this, and it also marked the artist as disliked."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"The message about library functions shows one more time, with the updated "
"list."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "Stricter checks of the requests that change your library."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Less work during playback with a long queue: the progress updates no longer "
"copy the queue."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"This release adds library management: create playlists, add songs to "
"playlists and to your library, and mark favorites and dislikes."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "Create playlists in your library."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "Add songs and albums to your playlists."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "Add songs, albums, and playlists to your library."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Add songs, albums, artists, and playlists to your favorites, and remove them "
"again, with the star button. In a song list, the star shows before the "
"duration: always for a favorite song, and when the pointer is over the row "
"for other songs."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Dislike songs. A disliked song shows dimmed in song lists, also after a "
"restart."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"A message tells which library functions are only available in Apple's apps. "
"The Account page in Preferences shows it again."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"The New page has a calendar icon, so it no longer looks like the favorites "
"star."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Fix: after a restart, the album and artist buttons of the player bar did not "
"open their pages until a new song played."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"A volume or position drag during a slow queue change gives only one change "
"to the player, not one for each step of the slider."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Fix: a quit while the player page was still loading showed a JavaScript "
"error dialog."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"This release adds the New page, the Made For You page, and a richer artist "
"page. It also makes the player more stable."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "New page: see the latest releases from Apple Music."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "Made For You page in the library: your personal mixes from Apple Music."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"The Artists page in the library shows the artist list and, next to it, the "
"albums in your library of the selected artist. The Open Artist Page button "
"over the albums opens the full artist page. In a narrow window, the list and "
"the albums show one at a time."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"The buttons of the app have rounded corners and no longer have the pill "
"shape."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"The artist page shows the latest release, the albums, the singles and EPs, "
"the live albums, the compilations, the playlists, the albums the artist "
"appears on, and similar artists, like in Apple Music. Each list scrolls "
"sideways, and lists without items are hidden."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"The artist page shows the genre, the origin, and the start year under the "
"name. The Info button opens all the information about the artist, with the "
"biography."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "The artist page and its information take a tint from the artist photo."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"On the artist page, each list with more items has a small Show More button "
"at the right of its title."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"A playlist description shows in one line. When it is longer, a small Show "
"More button opens all of it."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"A long album or playlist title wraps next to the artwork. The text moves "
"under the artwork only in a narrow window."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Songs on the Search, New, and artist pages show in columns that scroll "
"sideways, like in Apple Music."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"The Search page can search your library: use the Apple Music and Library "
"switch next to the search field."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"On the Search page, each section with more results has a small Show More "
"button at the right of its title. It opens a page with all the results of "
"the section."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "Fix: some albums and songs on the New page had no artwork."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "Fix: artists in the library and in the library search had no photo."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Fix: on a slow start, the Widevine module and the session could go to the "
"wrong folder, and autoplay could be blocked."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"When Apple Music changes its web page in a way that RingoMusic cannot use, "
"RingoMusic stops and shows a message. It does not restart the player again "
"and again."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"If the app and its player have different versions, RingoMusic tells you to "
"install it again."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Fix: after a crash of the player, RingoMusic plays the song again from the "
"position where it stopped. If the music was paused, it stays paused."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "The window stays responsive while a queue change waits for the network."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"The cache of Apple Music data saves new responses faster when it is large."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Artwork that shows in many places at the same time loads and decodes only "
"once."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "The filter of the library lists reacts faster in large libraries."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Fix: the animation was not smooth when an album opened from an artist page. "
"The page color now changes after the animation."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"The colors of the pages and of the player bar fade smoothly when they change."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "Fix: closed album and artist pages stayed in memory."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"The Flatpak package starts again. Versions 1.0.0 and 1.0.1 stopped at start "
"because the settings schema was missing."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Sign-in is faster: the Apple ID dialog opens directly. You do not have to "
"click the Sign In button on the site."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "First stable release of RingoMusic."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "Sign in with your Apple ID and play your Apple Music library."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "Search the catalog. Open songs, albums, and playlists."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "Control the queue. Use media keys and the GNOME Shell controls."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "The window adapts to narrow screens."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"The application checks for a new release once a day. You can turn this off "
"in the preferences."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "Known limits:"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "Only x86_64 is supported."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "You need an Apple Music subscription."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid "First pre-release. It tests the release pipeline and the packages."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"The application checks for a new release once a day and shows a message with "
"a link."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.MedaiP90.RingoMusic.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Turn the check off with the new \"Check for updates\" switch in the "
"preferences."
msgstr ""
